# The API build context is the repository root, so everything the .NET build
# does not need is excluded here. Build outputs are the important ones: copying
# a host bin/ into the image both bloats the context and lets a stale assembly
# built on a different platform shadow the one the container just published.

**/bin/
**/obj/
**/.vs/
**/.vscode/
**/.idea/
**/*.user
**/*.suo

node_modules/
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/.vite/

.git/
.github/
.gitignore
.gitattributes
.dockerignore

docs/
samples/
tools/
tests/**/TestResults/
artifacts/

data/
uploads/
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

LICENSE
README.md
**/*.md

Dockerfile
docker-compose*.yml
